                                    <TEXT TI="TI_1607075172">Steering Angle Sensor-electrical</TEXT>
                                    <LEVEL>2</LEVEL>
                                    <SDGS>
                                        <SDG SI="EXTRAINFO">
                                            <SD SI="Service_Relevant" TI="TI_1788665557">service at next halt</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Repair_Action" TI="TI_1033276305">Steering angle sensor/line/connector check/swap</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Enable_Conditions" TI="TI_541339316">6.5V &lt; Vbat
AND After Sensor initializing</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Type" TI="TI_1660869490">Continuous</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_369967846">500ms</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_1767280406">1) SENT(Single Edge Nibble Transmission) Peripheral Protocol Errors:
   FRI - Frequency Range Flag (Sync or Calibration Nibble Deviated +-25% from Nominal)
   FDI - Frequency Drift Flag (Sync or Calibration Nibble Deviated 1.5625% from previous Sync or Calibration Nibble received)
   NNI - Incorrect Number of Nibbles received
   NVI - Nibble Values Out of Range (Nibble Pulse Width check)
   CRCI - CRC Failure
   WSI - Wrong Status Nibble Received
2) SENT signal timeout
3) Vernier reserve error
4) Angle follower comparison</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_131098211">EPS receive valid TAS signal.</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_298787442">Normal Assist</SD>
                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_1203974766">40 dec</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_1001664531">Steering angle sensor fault
OR  Steering angle sensor signal line or connector fault</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Possible_Impact" TI="TI_298787442">Normal Assist</SD>
                                        </SDG>
                                    </SDGS>
                                </DTC>
                                <DTC ID="DLC.DLC_EPS.BV.BV_EPS.DOP.DD_DTCList.DTC.DTC_0x60CE54">
