                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Enable_Conditions" TI="TI_1650299723">1) N/A
2) 6.5V &lt; Vbat
   AND After Sensor initializing</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Type" TI="TI_1660869490">Continuous</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_70129351">1ms</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_1519952678">1) Check SAS decal status
2) When difference between absolute angle from SAS and Motor Position sensor under detected "straight driving condition" is bigger than 50deg</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_781119212">1) After SAS Calibration
2) No Same failure at next IGN cycle</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_298787442">Normal Assist</SD>
                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_1203974766">40 dec</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Cause_of_Failure" TI="TI_712926265">1) Steering angle sensor is not calibrated
