                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_1250997526">24ms</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_1600198588">1) SPC(Short PWM Code) 1, 2 Peripheral Protocol Errors:
   FRI - Frequency Range Flag (Sync or Calibration Nibble Deviated +-25% from Nominal)
   FDI - Frequency Drift Flag (Sync or Calibration Nibble Deviated 1.5625% from previous Sync or Calibration Nibble received)
   NNI - Incorrect Number of Nibbles received
   NVI - Nibble Values Out of Range (Nibble Pulse Width check)
   CRCI - CRC Failure
