                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Enable_Conditions" TI="TI_1967250372"> - Local voltage is within normal range (9-16V) 
 - PwrMod == IGN ON
 - BUS physical status </SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Type" TI="TI_1660869490">Continuous</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_426872011">failure to authenticate at any time</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_1982619194">The component shall set the DTC If any of the below listed conditions occurs:
- Message counter not updated continuously for 3 messages.
- uncontrolled jump of more than 20 counts w.r.to previous received message.</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_1892623778">The component shall clear the DTC if Message counter is getting updated properly at least once in subsequent message.</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_298787442">Normal Assist</SD>
