                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Enable_Conditions" TI="TI_1967250372"> - Local voltage is within normal range (9-16V) 
 - PwrMod == IGN ON
 - BUS physical status </SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Type" TI="TI_1660869490">Continuous</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Monitor_Rate" TI="TI_426872011">failure to authenticate at any time</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Failure_Criteria_Test_Result_NOK" TI="TI_1719764076">1）the First time when the Module is programmed:no keys at Fixed Ram Location or CRC fails or NVM write Fails
2）Normal Operating：CRC doesn’t match or CRC calculation fails or NVM Read Fails or Key/CRC NVM locations are with default value (0x00)</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Pass_Criteria_Test_Result_OK" TI="TI_1956184814">EPS will read public keys if Keys are corrupted then EPS will write the correct public keys in next ignition cycle.</SD>
                                            <SD SI="Limp_home_Action" TI="TI_298787442">Normal Assist</SD>
                                            <SD SI="DTC_Aged_Crieria" TI="TI_1203974766">40 dec</SD>
